        "name": "Blazing Stampede",
        "description": "Udyr gains movement speed and his first attack against each target will Stun them. Recast: Gain even more movement speed and immunity to immobilizing effects for a couple seconds. ",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Stampede Stance:</span> Udyr gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(25/31/37/43/49/55% + (0.05% bonus Attack Damage)) Move Speed</span>, decaying over 4 seconds. Additionally, Udyr's Attacks dash him to the target and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> for 0.75 seconds (6/5.6/5.2/4.8/4.4/4 second Cooldown per target).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Awaken:</span> Grants immunity to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizing</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disabling</span> effects and an additional <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(0.1% bonus Attack Damage) Move Speed</span> for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Udyr moves through units during the Move Speed boost, and his Attacks in this <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Stance</span> can't be cancelled.</span>",
